<title>UK: LB Schleswig-Holstein sets $75 mln four-year bond.</title>
<headline>LB Schleswig-Holstein sets $75 mln four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK SCHLESWIG-HOLSTEIN GIROZENTRALE</p>
<p> AMT    $75 MLN	 COUPON     *5.0	MATURITY    04.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.885   PAY DATE    04.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    100.485   SPREAD	+2.50 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR YEARS ONE AND TWO THEN 8.0 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-5</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED AUGUST 1999 AND JULY 2001</p>
<p>			    U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
